    "This initial analysis was conducted using JMP. However, throughout the workflow, several limitations became evident\u2014particularly regarding automation capabilities for experiments involving modified workflows and the reproducibility of annotated images.\n",
    "We are going to create a notebook that primarily builds on my existing codebase to generate a complete workflow for the analysis. Your task is to continuously generate tasks that build upon one another. The final goal is to create a notebook that runs the entire process for sex modeling and individual identification and benchmarking\u2014from data loading all the way to validation on the test set and inference prediction on the inference set (if available). I will always post the introduction and a few Notebook cells that are to build next  It will use softcoded variables of config whererver possible;\n",
